        "May/June and October/November series give a genuine resit route for a single weak subject.",
        "IGCSE subject choices can affect the eventual Supreme Council equivalency calculation years later.",
        "Universities look mainly at what follows IGCSE — American Diploma, A Level or IB Diploma — not IGCSE alone.",
